      "message": "You are adding a sysprop using aosp/2869079 but you are not using the sysprop in the code and instead you rely on the raw string.\n\nCan you make usage of the bluetoothProperties ?\ncf existing usage: https://cs.android.com/search?q\u003dbluetoothproperties%20f:cc\u0026sq\u003d\n\nnote that if this intend to target floss only, I don\u0027t understand why you are adding to system/libsysprop or system/sepolicy. Wouldn\u0027t it be simpler to use a Ifdef TARGET_FLOSS like is currently use on floss ?",
