      "side": 1,
      "message": "If the Android team would like to block the vendor from using this prop for now, then I think we can follow this approach: https://android-review.git.corp.google.com/c/platform/system/sepolicy/+/2870114/comment/d44f33ea_0bbbc916/ - So the use of the prop would be blocked on Android, until you move it to the bluetooth_config_prop group.\n\nTBH I\u0027m fine with using TARGET_FLOSS, but I just prefer a healthier approach (sysprop). If the Android team has a strong opinion of NOT using sysprop, then please let me know and I\u0027ll update the change. Thanks.",
